{"route":"/docs/5.3/helpers/focus-ring/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Focus ring","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Utility classes that allows you to add and modify custom focus ring styles to elements and components."},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"The <code>.focus-ring</code> helper removes the default <code>outline</code> on <code>:focus</code>, replacing it with a <code>box-shadow</code> that can be more broadly customized. The new shadow is made up of a series of CSS variables, inherited from the <code>:root</code> level, that can be modified for any element or component."},{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Click directly on the link below to see the focus ring in action, or into the example below and then press <kbd>Tab</kbd>."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"4dc1641bd7892a78ede6","height":147},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">\n  Custom focus ring\n</a>","language":"html"},{"id":"customize","type":"heading","en":"Customize","level":2},{"id":"customize--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Modify the styling of a focus ring with our CSS variables, Sass variables, utilities, or custom styles."},{"id":"css-variables","type":"heading","en":"CSS variables","level":3},{"id":"css-variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Modify the <code>--bs-focus-ring-*</code> CSS variables as needed to change the default appearance."},{"id":"css-variables--example-1","type":"demo","key":"fe0473500dfeb1c4e669","height":147},{"id":"css-variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"<a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\" style=\"--bs-focus-ring-color: rgba(var(--bs-success-rgb), .25)\">\n  Green focus ring\n</a>","language":"html"},{"id":"css-variables--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.focus-ring</code> sets styles via global CSS variables that can be overridden on any parent element, as shown above. These variables are generated from their Sass variable counterparts."},{"id":"css-variables--code-2","type":"code","value":"--#{$prefix}focus-ring-width: #{$focus-ring-width};\n--#{$prefix}focus-ring-opacity: #{$focus-ring-opacity};\n--#{$prefix}focus-ring-color: #{$focus-ring-color};","language":"scss"},{"id":"css-variables--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"By default, there is no <code>--bs-focus-ring-x</code>, <code>--bs-focus-ring-y</code>, or <code>--bs-focus-ring-blur</code>, but we provide CSS variables with fallbacks to initial <code>0</code> values. Modify them to change the default appearance."},{"id":"css-variables--example-2","type":"demo","key":"760457c1f9df2d1916bf","height":147},{"id":"css-variables--code-3","type":"code","value":"<a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\" style=\"--bs-focus-ring-x: 10px; --bs-focus-ring-y: 10px; --bs-focus-ring-blur: 4px\">\n  Blurry offset focus ring\n</a>","language":"html"},{"id":"sass-variables","type":"heading","en":"Sass variables","level":3},{"id":"sass-variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Customize the focus ring Sass variables to modify all usage of the focus ring styles across your Bootstrap-powered project."},{"id":"sass-variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"$focus-ring-width:      .25rem;\n$focus-ring-opacity:    .25;\n$focus-ring-color:      rgba($primary, $focus-ring-opacity);\n$focus-ring-blur:       0;\n$focus-ring-box-shadow: 0 0 $focus-ring-blur $focus-ring-width $focus-ring-color;","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Sass utilities API","level":3},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"In addition to <code>.focus-ring</code>, we have several <code>.focus-ring-*</code> utilities to modify the helper class defaults. Modify the color with any of our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/color#theme-colors\">theme colors</a>. Note that the light and dark variants may not be visible on all background colors given current color mode support."},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--example-1","type":"demo","key":"3b66621c7469cb6528c4","height":300},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-primary py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Primary focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-secondary py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Secondary focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-success py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Success focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-danger py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Danger focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-warning py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Warning focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-info py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Info focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-light py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Light focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-dark py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Dark focus</a></p>","language":"html"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Focus ring utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/api#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--code-2","type":"code","value":"\"focus-ring\": (\n  css-var: true,\n  css-variable-name: focus-ring-color,\n  class: focus-ring,\n  values: map-loop($theme-colors-rgb, rgba-css-var, \"$key\", \"focus-ring\")\n),","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"4dc1641bd7892a78ede6","html":" <a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">\n  Custom focus ring\n</a> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"fe0473500dfeb1c4e669","html":" <a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\" style=\"--bs-focus-ring-color: rgba(var(--bs-success-rgb), .25)\">\n  Green focus ring\n</a> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"760457c1f9df2d1916bf","html":" <a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\" style=\"--bs-focus-ring-x: 10px; --bs-focus-ring-y: 10px; --bs-focus-ring-blur: 4px\">\n  Blurry offset focus ring\n</a> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"3b66621c7469cb6528c4","html":" <p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-primary py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Primary focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-secondary py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Secondary focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-success py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Success focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-danger py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Danger focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-warning py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Warning focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-info py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Info focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-light py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Light focus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"d-inline-flex focus-ring focus-ring-dark py-1 px-2 text-decoration-none border rounded-2\">Dark focus</a></p> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/download"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contents"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/webpack"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/parcel"},{"en":"Vite","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/vite"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/accessibility"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/rfs"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/rtl"},{"en":"Contribute","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contribute"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/overview"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/sass"},{"en":"Options","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/options"},{"en":"Color","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/color"},{"en":"Color modes","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/color-modes"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/components"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/css-variables"},{"en":"Optimize","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/optimize"},{"en":"Breakpoints","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/breakpoints"},{"en":"Containers","href"